  "vibe": "Booth-black #16181d and #101216 with a purple #8b5cf6 and a signal green #3ddc84 that means live. Unbounded's wide geometric caps chop in from the left on a six-degree skew; items streak in after them. The world is a working booth: a twenty-two-bar meter breathes along the lower frame on two stacked sines with every fourth bar green, an ON AIR sign at the top right actually blinks — lamp, outline and lettering hard-switching together on a 2.8Hz sine — a fog-white condenser mic on a stand sits under three purple ring pulses that expand and fade, and a green scrub dot runs a playhead rule left to right on a loop. Statement is the one bright wall, a full purple frame at 144px. Levels read on a vertical tube; producer alerts slide in with draining timer bars; show notes type under a blinking caret.",
